{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>Do not harden your heart.</b> To speak to his heart good things." "<b>תקפוץ.</b> You shall close. So too קפצה פיה, קפץ באף, יקפצו מלכים פיהם. And it is a pa'al verb." "<b>The needy.</b> Some say it is from the root of ולא אבה, for it is in the pattern of עליון, and חביון and הגיון, whose roots are עלה, חבה, הגה. And the meaning is that he desires everything because of his lack."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {2 "The phrase י״א (yod-alef) abbreviates 'יש אומרים' = 'some say'; resolved by context."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:23:32.360973228Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}